{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2023-06-22 15:35:00', 'title': "WALT DISNEY WORLD RESORT HOSTS MORE THAN 650 FLORIDA YOUTH FOR WORLD'S LARGEST SWIMMING LESSON", 'text': "ON THURSDAY MORNING, WALT DISNEY WORLD RESORT HOSTED THE LARGEST SWIM LESSON SITE IN THE STATE OF FLORIDA AND ONE OF THE LARGEST IN THE COUNTRY AT DISNEY'S TYPHOON LAGOON WATER PARK AND OTHER RESORT HOTEL POOLS. LAKE BUENA VISTA, FLA."}{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2023-06-22 05:45:00', 'title': 'DIS LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI &\xa0KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY ("DISNEY" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: DIS) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF DISNEY INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD BETWEEN DECEMBER 10, 2020 AND NOVEMBER 8, 2022.'}